/* 大世界街巷事件库 卷2 / 十大主干街道日常与NPC偶遇 / 零编号命名 */
:: MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Domus Street">>
<</if>>
宅邸街七号院墙外的绿色旧邮筒底部卡着一封没有贴邮票的牛皮信封。<<mpAmbient>>你放缓脚步环顾四周，发现牛皮信封边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开遮挡细看牛皮信封 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_domus_postboxenvelope")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你顺着宅邸街七的掩护打开牛皮信封，将里面的旧银币与未鉴定古物揣进衣袋。<span class="green">你在宅邸街七顺遂起出了牛皮信封。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[整理行装原路返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	牛皮信封卡得颇紧，你伸手拨弄时指节蹭在粗糙的边角上，擦出了一道红印。<span class="red">指节被牛皮信封边角刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓口气重新尝试 (0:04)|MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖退回安全处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看清石缝走向慢慢抽起 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_domus_postboxenvelope")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你压住边角缓缓抽出，将牛皮信封连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你完好取出了牛皮信封。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回入口处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	街口忽然传来路人交谈声，你动作一滞，袖口蹭上了一点浮灰。<span class="red">为免引人注意，你先停手退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[等路人走远再试 (0:04)|MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回外围通道歇脚 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Barb Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Barb Street">>
<</if>>
