	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓口气重新尝试 (0:04)|MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回入口处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺着墙根暗槽稳妥移出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_barb_crushedwhistletin")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你屏住呼吸拨开暗扣，将锡制警哨盒连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的锡制警哨盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[暂且收手退回岔路口 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	远处响起马车碾过石板的声响，你手腕微偏没能着力。<span class="red">你收回手指，决定等街面安静些再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[等路人走远再试 (0:04)|MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

